      "text": "\n\nSubject: Update on your export request\n\nHi [Name],\n\nI am writing to let you know that the export feature you requested will be available one week later than originally scheduled.\n\nDuring our final validation phase, we identified a data-integrity issue that could have caused specific records to be omitted or misaligned in the exported file. We decided to pause the release to resolve this. We take the accuracy of your data seriously, and we did not want to deliver a feature that might compromise it.\n\n**What is being done:**\nOur engineering team is currently implementing a fix to ensure all data points are correctly mapped and verified before export. We are running a full regression test suite to confirm the fix works across all data types.\n\n**What to expect next:**\nWe are targeting a release date of [Date, one week from now]. We will send a separate confirmation email once the feature is live and ready for use.\n\n**For urgent cases:**\nIf you have a time-sensitive need for this data before the new release date, please reply to this email or contact our support team directly. We can manually generate the export for you to ensure you have the correct data without delay.\n\nWe apologize for the inconvenience this delay causes. We appreciate your patience while we ensure this feature meets the standard you expect.\n\nBest regards,\n\n[Your Name]\n[Your Title]\n[Company Name]\n[Support Contact Information]",
